# Protected Files

NEVER modify these files without explicit approval:

- `packages/excalidraw/scene/Renderer.ts` — render pipeline
- `packages/excalidraw/data/restore.ts` — file format compat
- `packages/excalidraw/actions/manager.tsx` — action system
- `packages/excalidraw/types.ts` — core types

## How to verify

If you must change a protected file (only with explicit approval):

1. Map call sites and data flow so the impact on render, actions, and file format is fully understood.
2. Run the full test suite for the workspace; fix any regressions before merging.
3. Complete manual QA on core flows (edit, save/load, collaboration if applicable) touched by the change.
